 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.6.3-rc22 — Creator Room likes
+
+- When someone in your instance taps ♥ under a card in the UnderWeb hub's Creator Room, UWX passes the like to underweb.cloud so the creator sees it on their profile (and the count shows under the card).
+- Only their display name, the card id and the world's check code are sent: no instance, world or anything about you. The server only accepts codes the hub world made and counts one like per name per card.
+
 ## 0.6.2-rc21 — Permanent ROOT ACCESS list
 
 - When the UnderWeb hub tells VRChat's log that someone in your instance has ROOT ACCESS (they finished CLEARANCE), UWX passes their display name to underweb.cloud so they stay on THE CORE board for good, not just while they're in the instance.
